    {
      "id": "transfer_steps",
      "partId": "transfer_to_computer",
      "itemIds": ["8fa4eb5b-870d-49d5-8858-1f9d85bac14d"],
      "kind": "operation",
      "text": "1. 按住录音笔背面的USB滑杆，沿箭头方向推出内置USB-A接口；\n2. 将其插入已开机的电脑USB端口；\n3. 录音笔屏幕显示“Connecting”即表示连接中；\n4. Windows系统：打开“此电脑”或“PC”，找到名为“IC RECORDER”或“MEMORY CARD”的设备；\n5. macOS系统：在Finder中查找名为“IC RECORDER”或“MEMORY CARD”的驱动器；\n6. 进入该设备后，录音文件默认存储于“RECORD”文件夹内（.mp3/.wav等格式），可直接复制到电脑。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "id": "725d85db7d8860da5f238a07:0",
          "quote": "Press and hold the\nUSB\nslide lever on the back of the IC recorder, and then slide it in the direction of the arrow to push out the USB connector. Insert the connector into the USB port on a computer that is up and running.\n\nMake sure the IC recorder is successfully detected by the computer.\n\nOn the\nWindows\ncomputer, open “\nComputer\n” or “\nPC\n,” and make sure that “\nIC RECORDER\n” or “\nMEMORY CARD\n” is detected.\n\nOn the\nMac\n, make sure that an “\nIC RECORDER\n” or “\nMEMORY CARD\n” drive appears on the Finder.\n\nThe IC recorder is detected by the computer as soon as a connection is made. While the IC recorder is connected to the computer, “\nConnecting\n” appears on the display window of the IC recorder."
        }
      ],
      "conditions": []
    }
  ],
