      "id": "first-pairing-phone-operation",
      "partId": "first-pairing-phone",
      "itemIds": ["7f384415-9a1c-4db3-8722-d8094e2585b6"],
      "kind": "operation",
      "text": "1. 拉出键盘背面电池仓的拉条以开机；此时Easy-Switch按钮LED应快速闪烁。若未闪烁，长按该按钮3秒强制进入配对模式。\n2. 在手机蓝牙设置中，确保蓝牙已开启并搜索新设备。\n3. 在可用设备列表中选择“Logitech Bluetooth® Multi-Device Keyboard K380”。\n4. 按提示完成配对（部分系统可能无需输入码）。\n5. 配对成功后，对应Easy-Switch按钮LED将常亮5秒。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "id": "179584a3850243398fb0853e:997",
          "quote": "Pull the tab on the back side of the keyboard to power it on.\n\nThe LED on the Easy-Switch button should blink rapidly. If not, hold down the button for three seconds.\n\nConnect your device using Bluetooth:\n\nOpen the Bluetooth settings on your computer to complete the pairing. Steady light for 5 seconds on the button indicates successful pairing."
        }
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "experienceIds": []
    },
    {
      "id": "switch-to-computer-operation",
      "partId": "switch-to-computer",
      "itemIds": ["7f384415-9a1c-4db3-8722-d8094e2585b6"],
      "kind": "operation",
      "text": "1. 确保K380已预先与目标电脑完成配对（如尚未配对，请先执行‘PAIR TO A SECOND COMPUTER WITH EASY-SWITCH’流程）。\n2. 短按任一Easy-Switch按钮（标有1、2或3），即可立即切换至该通道绑定的设备（例如：按按钮1切至手机，按按钮2切至电脑）。\n3. 切换后，对应按钮LED常亮，键盘输入即路由至该设备。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "id": "179584a3850243398fb0853e:1996",
          "quote": "Once paired, a short press on the Easy-Switch button lets you switch channels."
        },
        {
          "id": "179584a3850243398fb0853e:997",
          "quote": "Convenient Easy-Switch™ buttons make it easy to simultaneously connect with up to three devices via Bluetooth® wireless technology and instantly switch among them."
        }
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "experienceIds": []
    }
  ],
